    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1753006977\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Paradise Beach Simulator is a simulation game in which you build your business on a paradise island.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up beach activities, cook for your customers, and while they relax on their sunbed or enjoy the jacuzzi, take a jetski tour to explore the surroundings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your island to make it a spectacular place, craft your own souvenirs for the shop, plant your fruit trees, and discover the mysteries of the island... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>You are the manager of a little paradise.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf79Sun, towels and customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/892943e21ec8cc7d3becb7fccece6e6d.poster.avif?t=1753006977\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/892943e21ec8cc7d3becb7fccece6e6d.webm?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/892943e21ec8cc7d3becb7fccece6e6d.mp4?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Order your equipment and decoration, and wait for the express boat to deliver. Lay out your first towels and open your island! Your customers will arrive with the ferry, take care of their needs so they level up! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf79Prepare drinks and meals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/62ed495d657f08303df8acdb6c4a1918.poster.avif?t=1753006977\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/62ed495d657f08303df8acdb6c4a1918.webm?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/62ed495d657f08303df8acdb6c4a1918.mp4?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut, grill, assemble, serve! The meals and drinks you offer your customers will be fresh and local.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc20 Hunt And Harvest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/ecd2ce258cf1dfa47ab836e4e073f358.poster.avif?t=1753006977\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/ecd2ce258cf1dfa47ab836e4e073f358.webm?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/ecd2ce258cf1dfa47ab836e4e073f358.mp4?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam the island to spearfish and harvest the ingredients you need for your snack bar. Grow your own fruit trees and harvest their ripe fruits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddfdClean And Transform</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/6ec20720c213d4b934243af4c8e37fb9.poster.avif?t=1753006977\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/6ec20720c213d4b934243af4c8e37fb9.webm?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/6ec20720c213d4b934243af4c8e37fb9.mp4?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is in a sorry state: clear the waste to make the island clean and eradicate the old buildings. Maintain your equipment, otherwise your customers won't be able to use them!   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd3f Entertain Your Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/30b814296d2b200dfd5c605f2fd943e8.poster.avif?t=1753006977\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/30b814296d2b200dfd5c605f2fd943e8.webm?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/30b814296d2b200dfd5c605f2fd943e8.mp4?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer your customers numerous activities: sunbathing on the beach, jetski, jacuzzi, and many others. Customers have specific preferences, listen to their needs! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf05 <strong>Craft and sell items of your creation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/216e71773291fa95a7d915f62a3e6690.poster.avif?t=1753006977\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/216e71773291fa95a7d915f62a3e6690.webm?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/216e71773291fa95a7d915f62a3e6690.mp4?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customers love being able to bring back a souvenir from their sunny destination. Offer them for sale items of your creation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf05 <strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/5033787bdf44e4ccc4a28c287007cbb0.poster.avif?t=1753006977\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/5033787bdf44e4ccc4a28c287007cbb0.webm?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/5033787bdf44e4ccc4a28c287007cbb0.mp4?t=1753006977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The island hides a story and many secrets. Hop on your jet ski and go discover treasures all around the island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc81\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Recruit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will quickly need a helping hand! Recruit your employees based on their skills. </p>",
